+/* Frontier Experimental Remastered Studio UI System — UV Studio:
+   Obsidian #0b0b0b canvas, floating 22px #121212 studio columns, slanted trapezoidal document tabs,
+   Sun 40px hero metrics + #eff4cf KPI highlight cards, ControlPanel::SliderPill scrubbable tracks,
